      "body": "Implements the device.info capability for #2338 (queue task 14070).\n\n- Registers device.info as a one-shot request in the provider catalog (Join scope, default ceiling included); WANTS_VERSION and existing capability behavior unchanged.\n- id-core world_caps gains the typed DeviceManifest with the v1 wire shape from the capability taxonomy (2026-10-29 §3.1): manifest.v, display, input, sensors, audio, network. Unsupported manifest versions — in a manifest or in a request v argument — are refused with bad_args, never silently interpreted.\n- WorldActor serves the manifest from the adapter-boundary cached copy (new device_manifest field, enumerated once by the host adapter, never per request) and refuses unknown_cap when the host cannot describe its device.\n- Module header documents the plain JSON device.info request alongside the wants example.\n\nTests (oracle: the declared v1 manifest contract):\n- id-core world_caps: manifest wire round-trip; unsupported version / missing section refusal; request version negotiation. Full id-core suite: 331 passed.\n- id actor: result-event round-trip of the manifest; unsupported-version refusal; unknown_cap with no manifest. Full id lib suite: 2484 passed.\n\nCloses #2338\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796788007&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7941&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7941&signature=0a17b7887925668744d08447f804bf3d7cbae3c2efd5d91af631aa0d4be8ff57\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesm