      "body": "## Summary\n\n```text\nopen_world\n  restore program from journal\n  spawn_restored\n    capture request ids already present in wants\n    after_change refuses those ids as actor_denied / restarted\n    requests issued after open execute normally\n```\n\nAdds an explicit restored-world spawn path and documents restart semantics: because handled request ids are memory-only, open-time requests may already have executed before the restart. Refusing them prevents a duplicate unattributed side effect.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- **Before:** `handled_requests` starts empty after reopen; open-time `wants` requests execute with world authority.\n- **After:** three regression tests cover the refusal and reason, fresh requests after open, and restored-vs-fresh spawn behavior.\n- `cargo test --lib world::tests::` — 139 passed.\n- `cargo test --lib world_store` — 30 passed.\n- `cargo test -p id-core` — 263 passed, 1 pre-existing unrelated failure (`membership::layer::tests::test_a_sequential_named_create_is_refused_even_with_the_smaller_id`; reproduced when run alone).\n\n## Merge Danger\n\n**Door:** two-way\n\n**Blast Radius:** narrow\n\nOnly restored-world request IDs already present in `wants` are refused. Fresh worlds and post-open requests retain existing execution behavior. Reverting restores the previous at-least-once-on-restart behavior.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796257289&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=4677&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F4677&signature=d41dd32de82a2a30148614e93f517947e253b36e5f718954bdd47ab473391f27\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/4677?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
